  "clause_1_scope": "1.1 This standard ( Part 2/Sec 1 ), gives the method for determination of flow capacity for incompressive fluid in industrial process control valves. 1.2 The equations presented in this standard are based on the Bernoulli equation for Newtonian incompressible fluids. They are not intended for use when nonNewtonian fluids, fluid mixtures, slurries, or liquid-solid conveyance systems are encountered.",
